5373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lTRxYF8tqOUQ7kNvwEcNRPQ&_nc_oc=AdnZQAeynKPhL0gcLWfGftsON5tLaj7KNVi7nV2_6dKu_rQbcNcCZqKAT1JwzakmKMc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AftO8KB9S891rc0YMi07RSmAWVvNErH_P1-_KJp7faVpmQ&oe=69A96221"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5YfeDIWTY4UQ7kNvwHdH51h&_nc_oc=AdmiM2r-L5IUj94kYPbAWLEewPp6RNS6b_qU4Uo7tn_HN-DtHFL5bZG2f427ekWwDt4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AftRb8OW6WXnIWfSWzk4eTQ2LVC_t5YEep4ftrQz8XkYJg&oe=69A9872F"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3knd0yt-sZ0Q7kNvwGjM1Un&_nc_oc=AdlSQuHkPjal4mbh7vmARINluwi203BGnEcDGQq4n62X8yY5AkbbOUXI0RhGtotAgr0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Aft7Syyyuf67-Mlk3dVVcsU8gMnzg0O3zWW1gzF2BDAPpA&oe=69A986D2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=G8rD48wwLeIQ7kNvwHwKfjL&_nc_oc=AdlyFnCGt1JTW6V0MMoI2CqUZkMLTwqaXeIBFOIaRkT5hiQh4S7TWwZzNTJ_Jf_18W0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfujW3lVbRktuPCjGAW0pKSjbYva-kkj6LzJsdSz6FA5tg&oe=69A9907D"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.artisoft.pl/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_